%biconnected outerplanar graphs admit relative neighborhood drawings and Gabriel drawings\cite{LenhartL96prox}\\
%for maximal OP graphs drawing straight line min weight triangulations is known\cite{LenhartL96trig}\\
%can test in linear time if OP drawing with prescribed embedding admits planar rectilinear drawing\cite{Frati22}\\
