   283	\begin{lemma}\label{lem:cover-to-split}
   284	Let $G$ be a plane biconnected graph and let $S$ be a \cfc of $G$. Then $|S|-1$ splits are sufficient to merge the faces of $S$ into one. 
   285	\end{lemma}
