   360	The proof of the next theorem is very similar to the reduction of Bienstock and Monma to show \NP-completeness of \textsc{Face Cover}~\cite{bm-ccvfpg-88}; due to differences in the problem definitions, such as the connectivity of the face cover and whether the input graph is plane or not, we provide the full reduction for the sake of completeness.
